---
import { AI_SERVICE_CATALOG, AI_RISK_SAFEGUARDS, WHY_CHOOSE_US_REASONS } from '../data/insightsData';
---

<section
  id="why-choose-us"
  class="scroll-mt-20 border-t border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-950/70 py-20 sm:py-24"
  aria-labelledby="why-choose-heading"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-20">
    <!-- PART 1: COMPLETE 8-SERVICE AI CATALOG (OUTCOME-FOCUSED) -->
    <div>
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-300">
          Complete Enterprise AI Outcome Portfolio
        </span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
          8 High-ROI AI Capabilities Engineered for Measurable Outcomes
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base text-slate-400">
          Anyone can prompt an LLM to generate raw code. Companies hire Jobshore because we wrap AI in
          <strong class="text-white">deterministic math checks, automated verification gates, and auditable monthly ROI scorecards</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {AI_SERVICE_CATALOG.map((service) => (
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/90 bg-slate-900/60 p-5 transition hover:border-sky-500/40">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                <span class="rounded bg-sky-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-sky-400">
                  {service.code}
                </span>
                <span class="text-[10px] font-medium text-slate-400">{service.targetBuyer}</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-white leading-snug">{service.name}</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">{service.summary}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-3 text-[11px] font-medium text-emerald-300">
              Outcome Model: {service.pricingModel}
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PART 1.5: HOW WE TURN INTANGIBLE EXPERTISE INTO TANGIBLE, TRACKED MONTHLY OUTCOMES -->
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-sky-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-900/95 to-sky-950/30 p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-2xl">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-300">
          Making Intangible Value 100% Tangible &amp; Auditable
        </span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl">
          How We Prove Your ROI Every Month (Without Charging Per-User Seat Fees)
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300">
          Software engineering and AI architecture often feel "intangible" until something breaks. We turn our expertise into
          <strong class="text-white">hard, physical numbers on your P&amp;L</strong> through a 4-step telemetry loop:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80 p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-extrabold text-sky-400">STEP 01</span>
            <span class="rounded bg-slate-800 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-300">Day-0 Benchmark</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-white">Baseline Cost &amp; Time Audit</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            Before deploying a single line of code, we benchmark your current manual processing minutes per invoice, clerk overtime hours, POS/ERP license costs, and error rates.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80 p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-extrabold text-emerald-400">STEP 02</span>
            <span class="rounded bg-slate-800 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-300">Built-In Telemetry</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-white">Every Action Logs Value Saved</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            Every OCR document verified, 3-way PO matched, LHDN e-Invoice validated, or regression bug blocked automatically increments your live <code class="text-sky-300">Outcome_Ledger</code> counter.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80 p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-extrabold text-amber-400">STEP 03</span>
            <span class="rounded bg-slate-800 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-300">1st of Every Month</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-white">Monthly Executive ROI Scorecard</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            On the 1st of every month, your CFO &amp; COO receive an automated 1-page scorecard showing exact <strong class="text-white">Staff Hours Reclaimed, RM/USD Saved, and 99.4%+ Accuracy Proof</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80 p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-extrabold text-violet-400">STEP 04</span>
            <span class="rounded bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-emerald-300">$0 Per-Seat Tax</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-white">Outcome-Aligned Managed SLA</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
            You never pay punitive per-user seat fees. You pay a fixed milestone for setup + a predictable monthly Outcome SLA tied to uptime, regulatory updates, and verified throughput.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PART 2: WHY CHOOSE JOBSHORE (6 REASONS) -->
    <div>
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-300">
          Why Leading Teams Choose Jobshore
        </span>
        <h2 id="why-choose-heading" class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
          6 Reasons Enterprises Trust Jobshore Over Generic Agencies &amp; DIY AI
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base text-slate-400">
          We combine open-source cost freedom with deterministic engineering discipline—so your AI, ERPNext, and POS
          systems deliver guaranteed outcomes in the real world.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {WHY_CHOOSE_US_REASONS.map((reason) => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800/90 bg-slate-900/50 p-6 transition hover:border-emerald-500/40">
            <span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/15 font-mono text-xs font-extrabold text-emerald-400 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/30">
              {reason.number}
            </span>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-base font-bold text-white">{reason.title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">{reason.description}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PART 3: AI RISK & HALLUCINATION MITIGATION MATRIX -->
    <div id="ai-safety" class="scroll-mt-24 rounded-3xl border border-rose-500/25 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/90 to-slate-950 p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-2xl">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-rose-500/30 bg-rose-500/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-rose-300">
          Zero-Hallucination &amp; Enterprise AI Safety Architecture
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl">
          How Jobshore Eliminates AI Hallucinations, Data Leaks &amp; Ledger Risks
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Raw Large Language Models guess probabilities—which is unacceptable for accounting ledgers, tax compliance,
          or production code. Here is how our <strong class="text-white">Deterministic Verification Architecture</strong> neutralizes the 5 biggest enterprise AI risks:
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Semantic Risk vs. Safeguard Table / Cards -->
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
        {AI_RISK_SAFEGUARDS.map((item) => (
          <div class="grid gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80 p-5 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center">
            <!-- Left: The Risk -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-1.5 border-b border-slate-800/80 pb-3 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r lg:pb-0 lg:pr-5">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="rounded bg-rose-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-rose-400">
                  ENTERPRISE RISK
                </span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">{item.riskTitle}</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">{item.riskDesc}</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Right: Jobshore Safeguard -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-1.5 lg:pl-2">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">
                  ✓ Jobshore Safeguard: {item.jobshoreSafeguard}
                </span>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold text-emerald-300">
                  {item.badge}
                </span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">{item.safeguardDesc}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
